gaHX(){return'Total Return \u2014 (Unrealized P/L + Dividends on the shares you still hold) \xf7 Cost of those shares \xd7 100\n\nTrue all-in return on your current position, including both price appreciation and income.\nDividends earned by shares you have since sold belong to their realised P/L, not to this score \u2014 the amount beside each row is everything received.\nStocks with no investment recorded sort to the bottom, and so does a stock with a dividend whose exchange rate has not arrived yet (it shows "\u2014").'},
