gaKs(){return"High Risk"},
gaKt(){return"Weekly drawdown risk 7\u201315% \u2014 concentrated or volatile holdings."},
aKu(a){return"Your price snapshots average "+a+" trading days apart, which is longer than 5 trading days. The \u221aT scaling rule reduces weekly VaR proportionally \u2014 so the weekly figure may be lower than the per-period figure. This is mathematically correct, not an error."},
