gbe7(){return'This Privacy Policy applies to the Portfolio Keeper mobile application ("Service"). The Service is provided solely for personal entertainment and informal record-keeping and has no financial, investment, or advisory function whatsoever. The data controller is the individual developer of Portfolio Keeper, reachable via the Privacy Contact form in the app Settings. No data protection officer has been appointed. This policy is governed by Swedish law.'},
gbe8(){return"The Service does not use analytics, advertising networks, or third-party tracking SDKs of any kind. No tracking of users across apps or websites occurs. The crash reporting service (Sentry) described above is used solely for diagnosing application errors and does not track user behaviour or activity."},
